OL,3,GNEWSAWoman denies driving Lamborghini
OL,4,Ain fatal crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has denied being behind the
OL,7,Fwheel of a luxury supercar involved in
OL,8,Fa fatal high-speed crash on the M62 in
OL,9,FWest Yorkshire.
OL,11,FHumaira Batool, from Bradford, who was
OL,12,F22 at the time of the crash, is on
OL,13,Ftrial at Leeds Crown Court accused of
OL,14,Fcausing the death by dangerous driving
OL,15,Fof 20-year-old Mohammed Shaan Hussain.
OL,17,FThe pair were travelling in a hired
OL,18,FLamborghini Urus when it crashed near
OL,19,FRipponden, between junctions 22 and 23,
OL,20,Fin the early hours of 21 December 2022.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
