OL,3,GNEWSAWoman denies driving Lamborghini
OL,4,Ain fatal crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FProsecutor Christopher Dunn told jurors
OL,7,Fthe Lamborghini was driven by the
OL,8,Fdefendant "at grossly excessive speeds
OL,9,Fof up to 143mph [230 km/h], in wet
OL,10,Fconditions on the M62 motorway."
